⚡️🇺🇸 Blue Mississippi. After a very tight race in the deep-red state of Mississippi, with a very slim margin of victory, Democrat Scott Colom has been elected to the US Senate.

At the start of his campaign, Colom pledged not to accept money from the pro-Israel lobby or any other corporate PAC’s. He kept that promise. His defeated opponent, Cindy Hyde Smith, received significant support from AIPAC.

